  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Point it at public data folders or upload local instrument files; it sorts them into datasets by technique, overlays and normalizes spectra or thermograms across techniques, lets you edit sample metadata, and exports to standard formats or a reproducible notebook. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
